    dict(key='10-act-4', kind='console', title='Act Four — Shrinking, recursively',
         body='FOUR. Shrinking, recursively.\n  capacity 16, size 9\n  shrink_to_fit(): capacity 9, 9 copies at depth 9\n  17 songs in 32 places, delete_at_end down to 8: capacity 16 (a resize copying 8 songs, depth 8)',
         narration='Shrinking uses the same recursive copy. [[slnc 400]] Shrink to fit copies nine songs into exactly nine places, nine calls deep. [[slnc 500]] And when deletions leave only a quarter of the places in use, the array halves itself. [[slnc 300]] From thirty two places to sixteen, copying eight songs, eight calls deep.'),
